commands:
cd /workspaces/git-practical
git remote -v
If origin is not configured, add it:
git remote add origin https://github.com/anandajothi-2007/git-practical.git
git remote -v
If origin already exists, do not add it again.

output:
$ cd /workspaces/git-practical

$ git remote -v
origin  https://github.com/arfakamal/git-practical.git (fetch)
origin  https://github.com/arfakamal/git-practical.git (push)
